msgid "Returns one gallery as the page shows it: its layout type, its source with the images or the post query, its settings, and the Saved Layout it is synced with."
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:281
msgid "Create gallery"
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:282
msgid "Adds a gallery to a post, or creates a draft holding it: a page, or a post for a user who cannot create pages. The gallery starts from a layout (see get-gallery-options), takes a source and optional settings. A published post is updated at once."
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:288
msgid "Post to add the gallery to. Leave out to create a draft."
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:293
msgid "Title of the draft created when `post_id` is left out."
