msgid "Layout slug from get-gallery-options."
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:310
msgid "Id of a Saved Layout from get-gallery-options to sync the gallery with. The Saved Layout then provides the item blocks, the columns and the lightbox; `layout` still provides the blocks around them, and `settings` that differ from the Saved Layout's become changes of this gallery."
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:333
msgid "Update gallery"
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:334
msgid "Changes a gallery: the Saved Layout it is synced with, its layout, its source, its settings, and the images of an images gallery. Fields left out stay as they are. On a gallery synced with a Saved Layout, a setting the Saved Layout provides becomes a change of this gallery, as in the editor. A published post is updated at once."
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:342
msgid "Id of a Saved Layout from get-gallery-options to sync the gallery with: the gallery takes its item blocks, columns and lightbox, and keeps its source. `null` (or 0) detaches the gallery, which keeps its current look. Applied before the other fields."
msgstr ""

#: classes/class-abilities.php:347
msgid "New layout slug. The gallery keeps its source, columns, lightbox and items per page unless `settings` changes them; the blocks inside the gallery come from the new layout. Refused on a gallery synced with a Saved Layout unless the same call detaches it."
msgstr ""

